# Files Claude Code and other ripgrep-based tooling should not surface in
# search results or the file picker.
#
# This hides them from listing and search. Blocking the Read tool outright is
# done separately, in .claude/settings.json under permissions.deny.
.env
.env.*
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
key.properties
local.properties
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
secrets.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
example/.env
